{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 to lock local accounts after five failed password attempts and automatically unlock them after 300 seconds. The policy remained functional after a verified node reboot.","actions_performed":["Installed PAM-aware console login and SSH components.","Configured pam_faillock with deny=5, fail_interval=900, unlock_time=300, and local_users_only.","Verified five failures blocked the correct password, then verified automatic recovery after 317 seconds.","Restarted node1 once, confirmed its boot identity changed, and retested the lockout behavior.","Removed the disposable test account and credential artifacts."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Persistent five-attempt, five-minute lockout configuration","command_ids":["cmd-9091957ccba04aed","cmd-b717f5c3aff94b0d"],"summary":"Final PAM configuration contains the required faillock hooks, deny=5, and unlock_time=300; PAM-aware login and sshd are installed and active."},{"requirement":"Functional lockout and automatic unlock","command_ids":["cmd-fd8c2331c12d4a8f","cmd-d3898075dfb24d32","cmd-1fc78d154b264e3d","cmd-fcb8118722d042f7","cmd-22a8818dcc2a4deb"],"summary":"A known-good password initially worked; exactly five failures were recorded; the correct password was blocked inside the interval and succeeded after 317 seconds."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-de4ce851fdba441b","cmd-950e6f3bfe444802","cmd-738004d0ec1b49be","cmd-48670992affe496d","cmd-ee7ff6b4edb442b2","cmd-8d22072ae32e44ef"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot ID were captured, reboot was acknowledged, boot ID changed from 4fb98713-4560-47ed-8a3d-f2c13bcab8c3 to 6c9960ea-6f10-4cb9-98b3-3d82324e5b7a, and service, configuration, password authentication, and five-failure lockout behavior recovered."},{"requirement":"Disposable test cleanup","command_ids":["cmd-67b2ddebe4d94539","cmd-b717f5c3aff94b0d"],"summary":"The temporary test account and root-only credentials were removed; t